{#- Conflict-safe first contact. The first message carries only who is involved and how to reply, so the firm can check
    it doesn't already act for anyone on the other side before a confidence is shared. The visitor's own email app
    sends it; nothing passes through this site. -#}
{%- set fc = site.firstContact %}
{%- set ph = { title: fc.title, intro: fc.intro } %}
{% include "kits/law/partials/page-head.njk" %}
<div class="wrap lw-fc" data-feature="first-contact">
  <ol class="lw-fc-why">
    <li><b>Who is involved.</b> Your name, how to reach you, and the other people or companies in the matter. Nothing about what happened.</li>
    <li><b>We check.</b> We make sure we don't already act for anyone on the other side.</li>
    <li><b>Then we talk.</b> A partner calls or writes to you, and only then do you tell us more.</li>
  </ol>
  <form class="lw-fc-form" id="fc-form" data-js-only novalidate>
    <label for="fc-name">Your name</label>
    <input id="fc-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80">
    <label for="fc-reach">How to reach you <span>(email or phone)</span></label>
    <input id="fc-reach" name="reach" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="120">
    <label for="fc-area">It's about</label>
    <select id="fc-area" name="area">{% for a in site.practice.items %}<option value="{{ a.name }}">{{ a.name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option value="Something else">Something else</option></select>
    <label for="fc-parties">The other people or companies involved <span>(one per line)</span></label>
    <textarea id="fc-parties" name="parties" rows="4" required maxlength="800"></textarea>
    <p class="lw-fc-hint">Please don't describe the matter yet.</p>
    <p class="lw-fc-err" id="fc-err" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <button class="go" type="submit">Write the email</button>
  </form>
  <div class="lw-fc-done" id="fc-done" hidden tabindex="-1">
    <p>Your email app should open with this message to <b>{{ fc.email }}</b>. Nothing is sent until you press send there.</p>
    <pre class="lw-fc-msg" id="fc-msg"></pre>
    <p><button class="go" type="button" id="fc-copy">Copy the message</button> <a class="go" id="fc-open" href="mailto:{{ fc.email }}">Open my email app again</a></p>
  </div>
  <p class="lw-fc-plain" data-no-js>Email <a href="mailto:{{ fc.email }}">{{ fc.email }}</a> with your name, how to reach you and the other people or companies involved, and nothing more yet. Or call <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a>.</p>
</div>
